    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>Integrated into the</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>DocumentDB</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>for</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>VS Code</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>e</span><span>xtension</span><span>, the Index Advisor</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>enables</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>you to view and debug database performance. It uses natural language to recommend</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>optimal</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>indexing and best practices for your MongoDB workloads.&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/indexadvisordocumentdb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><br></div>",
    "Markdown": "Integrated into the DocumentDB for VS Code e xtension , the Index Advisor enables you to view and debug database performance. It uses natural language to recommend optimal indexing and best practices for your MongoDB workloads.\n\nLearn more ."
